=== intro

A dock worker catches your eye while you're checking manifests. "Hey, captain. Word is Frontier Station's medical supplies are running critically low. Plague or something. Just saying—if someone had supplies to sell..."

They shrug and walk away. Could be gossip. Could be an opportunity.

* [Note the tip]
  ~ flag frontier_med_shortage
  ~ chronicle "Market Intelligence"
    Heard a tip about medical supply shortages at Frontier Station. Could be profitable. Could save lives. Both, maybe.
  -> END

* [Ask if they know any other routes]
  -> routes

* [Ignore dock gossip]
  -> END

=== routes

The worker looks around, then leans in. "Look, I hear things. The Science Collective at Axiom Observatory pays top credit for artifacts. And if you're brave or stupid enough, Freeport Omega buys salvage, no questions asked."

They slip you a data chip. "Coordinates. Don't tell anyone where you got them."

* [Accept the coordinates]
  ~ discoverPort port_research_station
  ~ discoverPort port_pirate_haven
  ~ flag frontier_med_shortage
  ~ chronicle "Hidden Routes"
    A dock worker shared coordinates to ports off the beaten path. Axiom Observatory and Freeport Omega. Opportunities await.
  -> END

* [Decline—sounds risky]
  ~ flag frontier_med_shortage
  ~ chronicle "Market Intelligence"
    Heard a tip about medical supply shortages at Frontier Station. Turned down more dubious leads.
  -> END
